<p>The repository follows the tutorial suite's layout: one file per suite, group and test, the flows of a test
	under its folder, and everything several tests share under <code>common</code>:</p>
{{ codeblock.block('orcraft-test-suite-ftdi/
	requirements.txt
	test_suite_ftdi.py
	common/
		ftdi_gpio.py          the module as eight GPIO pins, through pyftdi
		gpio_link.py          the nibble protocol: frame, REQ/ACK handshake, sender and receiver
		module_test.py        base test for one module on one endpoint
		link_test.py          base test for two modules on two endpoints
		flows/                open module, close module, transfer message
		steps/                verify, open, close, blink, drive pattern, set and read pins,
		                      start receiver, send message, wait receiver
	test_group_leds/
		test_led_blink/
